{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"git status --short --branch && git log -4 --oneline && rg --files -g AGENTS.md -g '*semantics*' -g '*composition*' -g '*python*' -g '*antlr*' -g '*clj*' | head -180\"","aggregated_output":"## feat/p3prime-descriptor-cljpy\nb1eb3e40 merge: docs(archive) 6060a439 — the P2-prime step-7 review record (agy argon APPROVED findings, prompt, log) from the originating worktree\n6060a439 docs(archive): the P2-prime step-7 review record — agy argon APPROVED findings, prompt, log\n3c3015ee docs(archive): the yang-preludes P2-prime round record — engineer briefs (r1 sandbox-stall superseded, r2 resume-by-state), codex logs, session log (gate triage, merge, fresh-clone verification, owner rulings on track-scoped fixing)\na9977e58 merge: feat/p2prime-clojure-core (d6c9a265) — yang.preludes P2-prime: collision-free clojure.core.impl (pure, impl-* prefixed, admit-key?-guarded, zero state cells, policy tags in the handler contract, VM effects through the linker footprint) + cell-free clojure.core facade (idempotent init!, export, dynamic closures via the unified clj bridge); yang.clojure migrated onto unified clj + clojure.core, inline library duplication retired; locally-bound-map :k→9 native data-call dispatch and bundled get/assoc shadowing proven. Review agy argon APPROVED (NOTE-only). Jupiter gate: full quick lane 5226 tests/401057 assertions (failures = documented pre-existing master reds incl. dao.host.gate-test 29, verified master-identical), dao.stream green, frozen net green modulo the 5 float-address + linked-prelude reds, cljd parity 9+41 green\nsrc/clj/world/server.clj\nsrc/clj/world/datom/ollama.clj\nsrc/clj/world/blog.clj\nsrc/clj/dao/jing/content/driver.clj\nsrc/clj/dao/jing/dht/facade.clj\nsrc/clj/dao/stream/ws/jvm.clj\nsrc/clj/dao/stream/datagram/jvm.clj\nsrc/clj/dao/stream/waitset/driver.clj\nsrc/clj/dao/stream/http/jvm.clj\nsrc/clj/yin/demo.clj\nsrc/clj/yin/repl/run